	(text_box "LMR16010 EN: 1.2 V threshold, internal pull-up. Ren1 120k / Ren2 22k1 -> turn-on ~7.7 V (KL15 lockout, rides through cranking).
JP4 selects KL15 (1-2, default bridged) or the KL30 hysteresis switch (2-3).
FB 0.75 V: R9 43k / R10 7k5 -> 5.05 V. RT R12 39k -> ~620 kHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
